  "notes": [
    "Deep link with ?state=<state> reseeds the demo data for that screen and state. A hash without ?state keeps the current in-memory data (used by in-app navigation); on a cold load it seeds the default state.",
    "Checkbox data-el values sit on a 40x40 label wrapping the input; click the data-el to toggle.",
    "Elements with a 'state' field only exist in that state; others exist in the screen's default state.",
    "Toasts last 3.2 s (CSS animation). Approve/Reject cards slide out for 300 ms before the queue re-renders."
